WEBVTT

00:15:00.354 --> 00:15:02.314
What you are bringing to the table.

00:15:02.981 --> 00:15:05.525
How you are impacting the world

00:15:05.567 --> 00:15:09.071
and how you are changing
the music business as it is.

00:15:09.696 --> 00:15:12.407
And for me,

00:15:12.407 --> 00:15:15.994
that responsibility is always
at the core of everything I do.

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:20.207
When I'm setting myself
to write new songs,

00:15:20.207 --> 00:15:21.917
I don't think about Grammys.

00:15:21.959 --> 00:15:23.502
All I think about,

00:15:23.543 --> 00:15:26.380
how this song would help people.

00:15:27.422 --> 00:15:29.383
What impact is it going to have?